\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I should be home by 6:00. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"from ... to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the beginning and ending time of an activity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have classes from 9:00 to 3:00 every day.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on (Saturdays) ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" on the same day of the week  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't have classes on Saturdays.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "commuter train", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to travel regularly to and from a place and especially between where you live and where you work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Peter takes the commuter train every day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le01ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about daily routines.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "workout", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of physical exercise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I often try to get in a workout before heading home.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le01ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le01ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Frequency", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Adverbs of frequency (always, usually, never, etc.) say how often something happens.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5